-- title

Tests To Do

-- checklist

[] Section with invalid kind ``-- alfa invalid``.

[] P section with flags then attrs.

[] P section with attrs then flags.

[] Make sure section flags don't have 
a colon after the first word (so they
don't become attrs).

[] Section attr that spans multiple lines

[] Section flag that spans multiple lines

[] Don't capture ``-- alfa:\n`` as flag



-- notes list/

- When turning the AST back into 
a file the attrs and flags stay
in the same order with their
respective group, but the groups
are separated. This is

  -- code/

  -- p
  -- key1: value1part1 
  -- flag1
  -- key2: value2
  -- flag2
  -- key1: value1part2

  -- /code

  Becomes


  -- code/

  -- p
  -- key1: value1part1 
  -- key2: value2
  -- key1: value1part2 
  -- flag1
  -- flag2

  -- /code

  The attrs go first. 


-- /list
